# Keeps `docker build` (context = this directory, see ../haos/11-trace_node's
# Dockerfile and the lab justfile's `build` recipe) from tarring up things the
# image never needs — node_modules alone is ~276 MB of host-arch binaries the
# image reinstalls for itself with `bun install --production`.
node_modules
test
docs
scripts
.perf
README.md
DESIGN.md
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.log
.git
